OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a dry and bright start to
OL,6,Fthe morning cloud and patchy rain will
OL,7,Fspread across from the west through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon, turning heavier later.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FIt will be cloudy throughout
OL,11,Fthe evening with outbreaks of rain,
OL,12,Fheavy at times. Rain becomes
OL,13,Fpersistent and heavy overnight. Some
OL,14,Fblustery winds developing around dawn.
OL,15,
OL,16,CWednesday:FCloudy to start with
OL,17,Fpersistent and occasionally heavy
OL,18,Frain, and some blustery winds at
OL,19,Ftimes. This clears through the morning
OL,20,Fto allow increasing bright spells and
OL,21,Fa few showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
